---
import { cta, launchPlan } from '../../lib/site';
---

<section class="container-page pt-14 pb-section-tight lg:pt-24">
	<p class="anim-enter text-sm font-semibold text-amber-deep">
		Back-of-house software for independent caterers and meal-prep kitchens
	</p>
	<div class="mt-5 grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[7fr_5fr] lg:gap-16">
		<div>
			<h1 class="anim-enter max-w-[21ch] text-[clamp(2.125rem,1.35rem+2.9vw,3.75rem)] leading-[1.06] font-semibold" style="--enter-delay: 70ms">
				When the guest count changes, the kitchen plan shouldn&rsquo;t start over.
			</h1>
			<p class="anim-enter mt-6 max-w-[60ch] text-lede text-ink-soft" style="--enter-delay: 150ms">
				Enter the menu and guest count once. CostCook scales every recipe, combines the
				shopping list by supplier, rounds what you buy to whole packs, and builds the prep
				and pack checklists.
			</p>
			<p class="anim-enter mt-4 max-w-[60ch] text-base text-ink-soft" style="--enter-delay: 190ms">
				See the food cost before you quote. Approve a new supplier price, and future work
				updates while confirmed events keep the numbers you agreed to.
			</p>
			<div class="anim-enter mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3" style="--enter-delay: 230ms">
				<a
					href={cta.href}
					target={cta.target}
					rel={cta.rel}
					aria-label={cta.ariaLabel}
					class="btn-primary"
				>
					{cta.label}
				</a>
				<a href="#demo" class="btn-quiet">Watch the 1:51 product tour <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
			</div>
			<p class="anim-enter mt-5 text-sm text-ink-soft" style="--enter-delay: 290ms">
				<strong class="font-semibold text-ink">{launchPlan.displayPrice}</strong> {launchPlan.billingNote}
			</p>
		</div>

		<figure class="anim-enter-settle" style="--enter-delay: 260ms">
			<img
				src="/proof/v2-hero-money-mobile.png"
				alt="A confirmed CostCook order quoted at $26.92 per guest and 39.6 percent food cost, compared with $27.12 per guest and 39.9 percent at today's prices, a 0.7 percent rise."
				width="978"
				height="510"
				fetchpriority="high"
				decoding="async"
				class="h-auto w-full bg-paper shadow-ticket"
			/>
			<figcaption class="mt-4 max-w-md text-sm text-ink-soft">
				<strong class="font-semibold text-ink">The quote stays frozen.</strong> Today&rsquo;s price
				stays visible, so you know what changed without rewriting the event.
			</figcaption>
		</figure>
	</div>
</section>
